## Web parity matrix

For every web feature, document:

- web file/route
- API/client/model
- mobile current status
- implementation decision
- risk
- required screens
- required tests

Classify each feature:
- Implement now
- API exists but needs adapter
- Needs mobile UX decision
- Not applicable to mobile
- Blocked with proof

Do not use “missing backend” unless proven.

