## UI/UX rules

- Mobile-native, not desktop clone.
- Consistent with web brand.
- Premium but calm.
- Serious learning product tone.
- Clear hierarchy.
- Strong primary action.
- No clutter.
- No fake stats.
- No noisy gradients.
- No unreadable glass/blur.
- Excellent Japanese/Vietnamese readability.
- Safe at 360–390 dp width.
- Good tablet width constraints.
- Dark mode polished.
- Accessible touch targets.

## Tests required

